},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,87,65,52,68,72],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1022805","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,87,65,52,68,72],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"3200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1022805","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10060","city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[80,87,65,52,68,72],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"3200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006602","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1022805","horse":"WP1001315"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"位列河北四庭柱一正梁中的正梁，韩猛之叔，号河北老枪王，与颜良、文丑、高览、张郃并称。追随袁绍，讨董时随军征战，平公孙瓒时屡立奇功。袁绍败亡后归降曹操，曾在长坂坡之战中镇守曹军第四大营。韩琼原为袁绍麾下将领，曾征服辽东并统兵征伐河北六十四州。长坂坡之战中，因韩琼早年曾参与斩杀公孙瓒，致使赵云怀恨诈败，用梅花枪将其击杀。","tc":"位列河北四庭柱一正梁中的正梁，韓猛之叔，號河北老槍王，與顏良、文丑、高覽、張郃并稱。追隨袁紹，討董時隨軍征戰，平公孫瓚時屢立奇功。袁紹敗亡后歸降曹操，曾在長坂坡之戰中鎮守曹軍第四大營。韓瓊原為袁紹麾下將領，曾征服遼東并統兵征伐河北六十四州。長坂坡之戰中，因韓瓊早年曾參與斬殺公孫瓚，致使趙云懷恨詐敗，用梅花槍將其擊殺。","en":"Ranked as the ‘Central Pillar’ among the Four Pillars and One Central Pillar of Hebei, he was Han Meng's uncle and known as the Old Spear King of Hebei, counted alongside Yan Liang, Wen Chou, Gao Lan, and Zhang He. Following Yuan Shao, he campaigned during the coalition against Dong Zhuo and repeatedly won great distinction when subduing Gongsun Zan. After Yuan Shao's downfall, he surrendered to Cao Cao and once guarded the fourth camp of the Cao army at the Battle of Changban. Han Qiong was originally a general under Yuan Shao who conquered Liaodong and led troops in campaigns across the sixty-four prefectures of Hebei. At the Battle of Changban, because Han Qiong had participated in the slaying of Gongsun Zan in his early years, Zhao Yun bore a grudge, feigned defeat, and struck him down with his Plum Blossom Spear.","jp":"河北の「四庭柱・一正梁」における「正梁」に数えられ、韓猛の叔父にあたる。「河北の老槍王」と号し、顔良、文醜、高覧、張郃と並び称された。袁紹に仕え、董卓討伐に従軍し、公孫瓚の平定でも度々軍功を挙げた。袁紹の敗亡後は曹操に降り、長坂の戦いでは曹操軍の第四大営を守備した。韓瓊はもと袁紹配下の将として、かつて遼東を征服し、兵を率いて河北六十四州を征伐した。長坂の戦いにおいて、韓瓊がかつて公孫瓚の討滅に加わっていたことから、趙雲は恨みを抱いて詐敗し、梅花槍で韓瓊を討ち取った。","kr":"하북의 '사정주 일정량' 중 정량에 꼽히는 인물로, 한맹의 숙부이자 '하북 노창왕'이라 불리며 안량, 문추, 고람, 장합과 어깨를 나란히 했다. 원소를 섬겨 동탁 토벌전에 종군했고, 공손찬을 평정할 때 여러 차례 큰 공을 세웠다. 원소가 패망한 뒤 조조에게 귀순하였으며, 장판파 전투 당시 조조군 제4영채를 수비하기도 했다. 한경은 본래 원소 휘하의 장수로, 일찍이 요동을 평정하고 군을 이끌어 하북 64주를 정벌한 바 있다. 장판파 전투에서 한경이 과거 공손찬을 참살하는 데 가담했던 일로 인해 조운이 원한을 품고 거짓 패주하였고, 끝내 매화창으로 한경을 격살했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1025815","remark":"","surname":"韩","surnameTc":"韓","surnameEn":"Han","surnameJp":"韓","surnameKr":"한","surnameOther":"","name":"琼","nameTc":"瓊","nameEn":"Qiong","nameJp":"瓊","nameKr":"경","nameOther":"","word":"季子","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"韩琼2","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"80","force":"87","wise":"65","politics":"52","charm":"68","will":"72","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"12","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"85/27/27/27/27/19/50/27","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1002602;1003302;1004900","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1008105","battleSoul":"1011505","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"7000","battleSoulPoint":"8000","debateSoulPoint":"4600","strategy":"1014815","strategy2":"1008401","professions":